# Pin pnpm's virtual-store directory naming so it is identical on every OS.
# The default max length is 120 on macOS/Linux but 60 on Windows; store dir
# names longer than the limit get truncated + hashed. Our text-to-speech
# plugin's name is 64 chars, so Mac kept the full name while Windows hashed
# it — and `cap sync` writes these resolved paths into
# android/capacitor.settings.gradle, making that generated file ping-pong
# between machines on every sync. Pinning to the Windows value (the stricter
# of the two) makes the layout — and the generated gradle file — identical
# everywhere.
# After pulling this on another machine: delete node_modules and `pnpm install`.
virtual-store-dir-max-length=60
